{"title":"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the least prime number that can be written as the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> distinct prime numbers. What is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/e/3fe1ff9e5d834a499fb0c2fc0b5597c94cacf1b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }5\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }7\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }8\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }10\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the requested sum be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/7/0d7e49ad93a99ed6dcafd1c6acba511a181ab6a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the only even (and the smallest) prime, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is odd. It follows that the five distinct primes are all odd. The first few odd primes are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/0/b9040e13adc1f40cb3c010d2053d180a054a1b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3,5,7,11,13,17,19,\\ldots.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"188\" height=\"17\" /> We conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6c2a0dbac595f610c17d7adb0b06568fcdcac85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S&gt;3+5+7+11+13=39,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"238\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/5/e058d401a1b942f106f081ff1fcca8a8b1d42a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$39$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> is a composite. The next possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/3/70310af85defe1bd30cf717da3a0294fd769e49f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+5+7+11+17=43,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"17\" /> which is a prime. Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/e/ffee5ff1562bb8992555b8ee1a6d12f3cbdea00e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=43,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> and the sum of its digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/21784d6a3b4dba08456191a9e384b0f03b38a047.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+3=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }7}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"127\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We notice that the minimum possible value of the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> odd distinct primes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/9/d095d67f4181262dd6d150d077d9b410dd863a4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 5 + 7 + 11 + 13 = 39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"197\" height=\"15\" />, which is not a prime. The smallest prime greater than that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba6cdde56f366d628a7a35826f98523dbe58bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. However, this cannot be written as the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> distinct primes, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is not prime. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/8/c38d81afc2fb4328ead7dde7d51221bdbac7bc53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fb0c42671245a5bea34df3205c31f98e8768d98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 5 + 7 + 11 + 17 = 43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"197\" height=\"15\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c933938059852a76b5a2a95d95f0123c5779a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"122\" height=\"30\" /> \n</p><p>~andliu766\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4mf18UuZENw\">https://youtu.be/4mf18UuZENw</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/FNjAZf17K4o\">https://youtu.be/FNjAZf17K4o</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I\">https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I</a>\n~MC\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VJpw7eu7s6M\">https://youtu.be/VJpw7eu7s6M</a>\n</p><p>~mr_mathman\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/j-37jvqzhrg?si=5uruPdMajz7B8jhy&amp;t=307\">https://youtu.be/j-37jvqzhrg?si=5uruPdMajz7B8jhy&amp;t=307</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SQ74nt3ynw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SQ74nt3ynw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/uKXSZyrIOeU?t=900\">https://youtu.be/uKXSZyrIOeU?t=900</a> \n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Dr. David\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Gka4ivb0AEw\">https://youtu.be/Gka4ivb0AEw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video Solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4b_YLnyegtw&amp;t=563s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4b_YLnyegtw&amp;t=563s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A\">2024 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2023 AMC 10B Problems\">2023 AMC 10B Problems</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2024 AMC 10B Problems\">2024 AMC 10B Problems</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\